 because that's already wired up and firing — it's a natural flush point if entire wanted to pull a transcript at end of session.\n\n\npayload is empty on both hooks — Kiro isn't piping anything to stdin on Windows. So there's genuinely nothing we can do on our side to get the real payload. The fix has to come from either Kiro or entire.\n\nTwo options worth raising:\n\nKiro passes the hook payload as a command-line argument or env var instead of stdin — entire-agent-kiro could then read it that way on Windows\nKiro writes its own session/transcript file to disk (like Claude Code does) that entire-agent-kiro can read independently of the hook payload\nUntil one of those happens, the session files will stay empty on Windows. Strip the debug logging back out since we have our answer:\n\n\nBack to the simple version. Add this to your message to the entire team — Kiro doesn't pipe stdin on Windows, so the payload never arrives and session files stay empty. The ask is either env var/arg delivery of the payload, or reading Kiro's session files directly.\n--\nauthor:\talishakawaguchi\nassociation:\tmember\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nHi @sameerkhandisney thank you for the feedback. I'll take a look at the issues you ran into and get back to you soon.\n--\nauthor:\tsameerkhandisney\nassociation:\tnone\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\n@alishakawaguchi any update on this request? i know you guys are busy shipping a bunch of other features at entire \n--\nauthor:\talishakawaguchi\nassociation:\tmember\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\n> [@alishakawaguchi](https://github.com/alishakawaguchi) any update on this request? i know you guys are busy shipping a bunch of other features at entire\n\nHi! I'm actively working on this but if you'd like to contribute a fix feel free to open a PR at https://github.com/entireio/external-agents and I will review it ASAP.\n--","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"65428a0e-6195-434e-88f2-837d8289a8b0","timestamp":"2026-05-06T00:13:48.141Z","t